le=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">1. 공모 내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #3e57a5\">-The 4th Consulting Mission: KIT의 똑똑한 생각으로 우리선배의 창업기업을 UP 시켜라!</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" bgcolor=\"#e3e2f2\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">수진 기업</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"500\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">주식회사 스마트업(창업기업)</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" bgcolor=\"#e3e2f2\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">공모 주제</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"500\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">스마트커머스 사이트 오마이스타(Oh! MY STAR)의 스마트 UP 전략</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" bgcolor=\"#e3e2f2\" height=\"156\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">공모 내용</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(택 1)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"500\" height=\"156\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 스마트한 제휴 전략:</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\">:스마트커머스 창업기업으로서 카페베네, 아웃백 등과 같은 대형 브랜드들을 입점 시킬 수 있는 똑똑한 제휴 전략 </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 스마트한 런칭 전략:</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\">:스마트커머스 사이트 오마이스타(Oh! My STAR)의 알뜰살뜰 런칭 전략</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">* 스마트커머스 사이트 오마이스타는 현재 개발단계로 2012년 초 오픈 예정입니다. 창업기업으로서&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;대형 브랜드들을 입점 시킬수 있는 제휴 방안과 알뜰살뜰한 런칭 전략을 기다리고 있겠습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">* 기업 소개 및 서비스 정보는 대회 홈페이지</span>(<a href=\"http://club.cyworld.com/KIT-AugustRush\" target=\"_self\">http://club.cyworld.com/KIT-AugustRush</a>)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;‘The 4th BCC' 게시판을 통해 다운로드 받으실 수 있습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2. 참가 자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 금오공과대학교 재학(휴학)생이면 누구나 참여 가능</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 5인 이내의 팀 참가 가능(개인 참가 불가)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">3. 대회 일정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"143\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"53\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대회 오리엔테이션</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"143\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"53\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">작품 접수 마감</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"151\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"53\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">본선 진출자 발표</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"143\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"53\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">최종본선 &amp; 시상식</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"143\" height=\"64\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">11월 16일(수),</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">오후 7시</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">장소 : G428</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"143\" height=\"64\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">11월 25일(금)</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"151\" height=\"64\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">11월 28일(월)</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"143\" height=\"64\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">12월 1일(목)</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 예 선 : 접수된 완료기획서의 서류심사를 통해 본선 진출팀(총 6팀) 선발 </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 본 선 : 경쟁 프레젠테이션 및 시상 (12월 1일, GB109)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">4. 심사 기준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 아이디어의 창의성(30%), 연구방법의 타당성(20%), 연구결과의 기대효과(30%), 완성도 및 노력정도(20%)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">5. 시상 내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 대 상&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span>1팀 : 상장 및 상금(100만원)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 금상 <span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span>1팀 : 상장 및 상금( 50만원)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 은상<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span>1팀 : 상장 및 상금( 30만원)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 동상<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span>3팀 : 상장 및 상금( 10만원)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">6. 작품 접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 접수 서류 : ① <span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">참가신청서, ② 완료기획서(PPT 15~30Page), ③ 재학증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 접수 기간 : 2011년 11월 17일 ~ 25일 오후 6시까지</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 접수 방법 : E-mail 접수 (접수처: <a href=\"mailto:my-2-star@nate.com\">my-2-star@nate.com</a>)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">* 참가신청서는 대회홈페이지(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #800080; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">http://club.cyworld.com/KIT-AugustRush</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">)에서 다운 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">7. 대회 문의 및 자료 제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- <span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">전화 문의 : 어거스트러쉬 4기 회장: 도천석(010-4114-7333, </span><a href=\"mailto:my-2-star@nate.com\">my-2-star@nate.com</a>) </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 대회 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://club.cyworld.com/KIT-AugustRush\" target=\"_self\">http://club.cyworld.com/KIT-AugustRush</a>)의 'The 4th BCC' 게시판</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">8. 주최 및 후원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 주최 및 주관 : KIT 비즈니스 컨설팅 동아리 AugustRush </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\">- 후원 기업 : 주식회사 스마트업</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
